CMS:
====

For printing GC activity
-XX:+PrintGCDateStamps -XX:+PrintGCTimeStamps -XX:+PrintGCDetails -XX:+PrintHeapAtGC -XX:+PrintGCApplicationStoppedTime

This is good enough for adding to your inside IDE JUnit runs or Perf runs
-XX:+PrintGCTimeStamps -XX:+PrintGCDetails -Xloggc:./log/testname.log


Young Gen Size:
===============
-XX:NewSize=128m -XX:MaxNewSize=256m -XX:NewRatio=3 (will ensure young gen is 1/3rd of the total heap)
